  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Turkey &amp; Syria Earthquake Emergency Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In early morning of 6th of February (local time), a huge earthquake struck southern part of Turkey and more than 4,800 people have died, more than 20,000 people have been injured (as of 17:00(JST) 7th Feb.) JEN has been providing assistance to Syrian refugees and host communities with a partner organization in exactly the same areas, Gaziantep in Turkey where the earthquake hit. In order to support people&apos;s lives and livelihoods, we will provide emergency assistance to the affected people.</narrative>
  </description>
